                "summary": "Reviewed the full diff of recognise.ts, styles.css, recognise.test.mjs and recognise.md against the NG-45 contract. Hands-seen row uses handsSeen via toLandmarkFrame (same sides as previewShapes), updated per frame only in countdown/recording without show(); reset to 0 and 5 dots on each starting. Tick chain 5..1 is scheduled at recording start, cancelled in stopCamera (covers finish, back, failure, dispose) and never calls show, so the press guard is untouched; tests confirm time.pending()==0 after Stopp and after the time limit. Preview wrapper drops and closes a preview whose show throws (capture already swallows the rethrow and later draw is a no-op on a closed preview); a later throwing createPreview finds preview=null and an empty slot. Built and ran test/recognise.test.mjs: 35/35 pass. Layout fit at 320x480..820x1180 is only checked through the documented headless measurements, not re-measured here.",
