                    "src/recognise/recognise.ts:396-403 hand count follows every tracked frame with no hysteresis: a tracker dropping a hand on single frames toggles the row and the 6px picture frame between orange and green at frame rate; orange #b35400 and green #1d6b40 have similar luminance so this is not a WCAG 2.3.1 flash, but it may be restless or alarming for motion-sensitive children; a short hold (e.g. require ~300 ms before turning orange) is a candidate follow-up for the child trial.",
