                "submission_id": "submission:blindspot-review:1:3938830e",
                "summary": "Blind-spot review of the NG-45 feedback row: no blocking issue. Per-frame hand updates go to a non-live text span (only on change) outside the role=status line, so screen readers are not flooded; the dots' aria-label on role=img changes without a live region. Meaning is not colour-only (number of lit hands plus words). Dots step without transition. The tick is guarded by camera identity and recording state, cancelled in stop, and tested to leave no pending timer. The show-throws wrapper closes an idempotent preview (createCapturePreview close is idempotent, draw is a no-op after close). Nothing is stored or sent; handsSeen only counts. Back button path unchanged. Layout measured 320x480 to 820x1180 in docs; not re-run here.",
